{quote}# Record a Walkthrough: the dialog now uses the site’s standard dialog header with a close button, the site’s date picker and the centered save bar, like the other dialogs.
# What Scout Can Do on District and School Insights: the button is back in Scout’s sidebar for admins, and “See Everything Scout Can Do” shows under the starter questions. It lists the questions admin Scout answers from the Insights figures, in three groups: Results, Schools and Classes, and Share. District-wide you see questions about the district’s schools (for example “Which schools need support?” and “Can I download the district summary?”); with one school picked, or as a school admin, you see that school’s questions (for example “Which classes have had no scored assessment lately?” and “Can I download the principal brief?”). Clicking a card asks Scout that question in a new chat, and the search box filters the cards (try “standards” or “walkthroughs”).{quote}
